@goranovs When you export your Android binaries, can you enable the [`gradle_build/compress_native_libraries`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_editorexportplatformandroid.html#class-editorexportplatformandroid-property-gradle-build-compress-native-libraries) option. 

This should accomplish the behavior described in https://developer.android.com/guide/practices/page-sizes#update-packaging. 
Let us know if this addresses the issue.
